0\u00b0 Live-Streams in 3D - als w\u00e4rst du selbst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=atLM9XrAIeQQ7kNvwGWpRsj&_nc_oc=Adq-E9e70fXeoNiiNWF-1zX6Rumvq3fnByqogNaQdPdtHrygj-cN4EsLiC-mS8fBeNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJprBXVuWvf4P_h6KXS0CgtgNlxaoqkmgawENxXNX7f7Q&oe=6AB3C256"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Re0JzRXaySAQ7kNvwHbNl6m&_nc_oc=AdoxBIBHMODT_jKjD6dsjPS3LW5RumWRpYZZmLr0FJoiMMhxj0EGHM7Gn9w1P5v2vVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLmeMTyH3zfCiC9BlxcziZ0c4dTKkdr3G252X7Jf12VSA&oe=6AB3CC2D"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9THLDG6Ct08Q7kNvwE5gmxG&_nc_oc=AdpRb_uF6ayhz8w8w5byC_LfG3gkEJ9njHn10O9Uh6ytNznD6vUELQbwWeB8kMQYtQs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLq2Y8dIminQtW6HsEfz87uZurigyWFx4oAglNUX5HgYg&oe=6AB3C46D"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_ca